(5539829, 801129, 90947, '<td valign="top">I just had to smile.  I guess that is what this challenge is all about.  My wife has a very similar shot on her windows desktop.  I guess that must mean the subject is good.  I might have tried to slide the main subject from dead center. It appears that the foreground leaf is the focus point and not the flower.</td>', 'I just had to smile.  I guess that is what this challenge is all about.  My wife has a very similar shot on her windows desktop.  I guess that must mean the subject is good.  I might have tried to slide the main subject from dead center. It appears that the foreground leaf is the focus point and not the flower.', '2009-06-22 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539831, 801142, 90947, '<td valign="top">This is a real attention getter: gravity defying water in bowls.  I love it.  I like the low key overall feel and while one can see the water in the bowls, the leaves still look like they are floating on nothingness.  Great!</td>', 'This is a real attention getter: gravity defying water in bowls.  I love it.  I like the low key overall feel and while one can see the water in the bowls, the leaves still look like they are floating on nothingness.  Great!', '2009-06-22 15:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539835, 800904, 90947, '<td valign="top">Great pastel.</td>', 'Great pastel.', '2009-06-22 15:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539838, 800393, 90947, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field control and color contrast between flora and fauna.</td>', 'Great depth of field control and color contrast between flora and fauna.', '2009-06-22 15:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539843, 800324, 90947, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, but I am not sure there is anything serene about it.  Your excellent use of long exposure shows considerable activity.  It is a perhaps a place in which one could find serenity... somewhat removed from "the roar of the maddening (water) crowd".  9 for style and quality.</td>', 'I love this photo, but I am not sure there is anything serene about it.  Your excellent use of long exposure shows considerable activity.  It is a perhaps a place in which one could find serenity... somewhat removed from "the roar of the maddening (water) crowd".  9 for style and quality.', '2009-06-22 15:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539846, 800981, 90947, '<td valign="top">This, I feel should be in one of the winner''s circles.  I debated for sometime about whether the stems should meet at the base of the photo or not.  I never decided.<br/> <br/>The lighting is superb.  I would love to learn how to do that someday.</td>', 'This, I feel should be in one of the winner''s circles.  I debated for sometime about whether the stems should meet at the base of the photo or not.  I never decided. The lighting is superb.  I would love to learn how to do that someday.', '2009-06-22 15:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539848, 801081, 90947, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  I bit too abstract for me, but I do understand where you were going with the shot.  You had to have worked very hard to get the effect.  I don''t think I like the white lines bounding the top and bottom, but everyone to his or her own taste.  <br/> <br/>Excellent work.</td>', 'Very interesting.  I bit too abstract for me, but I do understand where you were going with the shot.  You had to have worked very hard to get the effect.  I don''t think I like the white lines bounding the top and bottom, but everyone to his or her own taste.   Excellent work.', '2009-06-22 15:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539851, 800674, 90947, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  It almost looks like it had some selective desaturation.  I do like the soft focus, but I think a little additional sharpness at the leaf and perhaps a little more depth of field would not have gone amiss.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  It almost looks like it had some selective desaturation.  I do like the soft focus, but I think a little additional sharpness at the leaf and perhaps a little more depth of field would not have gone amiss.', '2009-06-22 16:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539856, 801086, 90947, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I am not sure about bubbles and ripples, but it is very nice.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I am not sure about bubbles and ripples, but it is very nice.', '2009-06-22 16:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539859, 801130, 90947, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.  What am I looking at?  Is it a nun holding flowers?  I like soft focus and the idea of fading into nothingness, I just wish I had seen the image before it had faded so far.</td>', 'I don''t get it.  What am I looking at?  Is it a nun holding flowers?  I like soft focus and the idea of fading into nothingness, I just wish I had seen the image before it had faded so far.', '2009-06-22 16:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539874, 800756, 90947, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject for the challenge.  I think it could have used a little light fill from the subjects lower right.  Some of the statue''s detail get lost... or not.  I guess it is an issue of my display.  Very good.</td>', 'Excellent subject for the challenge.  I think it could have used a little light fill from the subjects lower right.  Some of the statue''s detail get lost... or not.  I guess it is an issue of my display.  Very good.', '2009-06-22 16:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539878, 800988, 90947, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  Looks suitable for a father''s day card... that is meant as a compliment.</td>', 'Nice work.  Looks suitable for a father''s day card... that is meant as a compliment.', '2009-06-22 16:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539887, 800927, 90947, '<td valign="top">I guess leaves floating on invisible water is the way to go on this challenge.  Absolutely gorgeous.  Great lighting.</td>', 'I guess leaves floating on invisible water is the way to go on this challenge.  Absolutely gorgeous.  Great lighting.', '2009-06-22 16:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539892, 800937, 90947, '<td valign="top">Great snapshot of a loving big brother.</td>', 'Great snapshot of a loving big brother.', '2009-06-22 16:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539904, 800926, 90947, '<td valign="top">I am not sure I understand why you chose the title you chose or what the shell pasta as the secondary subject, but that is a discussion for another time.  The shot is beautifully lit and composed, for what you were creating.  I think the shot of mother natures beauty buried in a crusty exterior might provoke some thoughts.</td>', 'I am not sure I understand why you chose the title you chose or what the shell pasta as the secondary subject, but that is a discussion for another time.  The shot is beautifully lit and composed, for what you were creating.  I think the shot of mother natures beauty buried in a crusty exterior might provoke some thoughts.', '2009-06-22 16:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539909, 801076, 90947, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful and unlike another falling water shot, the feathery nature of the long exposed water falls makes this one seems peaceful.  I don''t know if the spot was actually quiet enough for contemplation or not, but the photo makes it feel that way.  I like the color in this.  I think this is a case where B&amp;W would loose something.</td>', 'This is beautiful and unlike another falling water shot, the feathery nature of the long exposed water falls makes this one seems peaceful.  I don''t know if the spot was actually quiet enough for contemplation or not, but the photo makes it feel that way.  I like the color in this.  I think this is a case where B&W would loose something.', '2009-06-22 16:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539910, 800537, 90947, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.  I wish it didn''t have the bright spot in the midst of the green.  Those damn leaves, they just go where they want.  :-)</td>', 'Wonderful shot.  I wish it didn''t have the bright spot in the midst of the green.  Those damn leaves, they just go where they want.  :-)', '2009-06-22 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539911, 800983, 90947, '<td valign="top">Oh... It is a guitar neck and pick.  What every it is that is in the background confused me.  Very abstract.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Oh... It is a guitar neck and pick.  What every it is that is in the background confused me.  Very abstract.  Nice shot.', '2009-06-22 16:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539912, 801102, 90947, '<td valign="top">I like the gray green hues.  Great composition and lighting.</td>', 'I like the gray green hues.  Great composition and lighting.', '2009-06-22 16:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539914, 800928, 90947, '<td valign="top">Great line.  How did you keep that guy still for so long?  Nice sharp focus where you needed it.</td>', 'Great line.  How did you keep that guy still for so long?  Nice sharp focus where you needed it.', '2009-06-22 16:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539917, 800834, 90947, '<td valign="top">What is it that causes the glow around the rock?  I love the perfect stillness of the mirror like lake reflection.  Sorry, the big rock really does nothing for me.  <br/> <br/>Second thought:  Oh, I think I get it.  It is the reflection of the reflection of the sky masked by the rock.  Interesting.</td>', 'What is it that causes the glow around the rock?  I love the perfect stillness of the mirror like lake reflection.  Sorry, the big rock really does nothing for me.   Second thought:  Oh, I think I get it.  It is the reflection of the reflection of the sky masked by the rock.  Interesting.', '2009-06-22 16:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539919, 801135, 90947, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  The black and white and high contrast certainly adds starkness<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-06-29 03:20:01.</i></td>', 'Nice composition.  The black and white and high contrast certainly adds starkness', '2009-06-22 16:27:22.000000', '2009-06-29 04:20:01.000000', 1),
(5539920, 801085, 90947, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I am not sure what it has to do with peace and quiet and serenity, but it is an excellent abstract shot.</td>', 'Interesting.  I am not sure what it has to do with peace and quiet and serenity, but it is an excellent abstract shot.', '2009-06-22 16:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5539933, 800974, 90947, '<td valign="top">Very interesting use of HDR(?) Was the vignetting intentional?  The colors are vibrant, almost other worldly.  <br/> <br/>This is one of the shots that really caught my eye when I browsed the thumbnails, which, I guess, is what a photo should do.</td>', 'Very interesting use of HDR(?) Was the vignetting intentional?  The colors are vibrant, almost other worldly.   This is one of the shots that really caught my eye when I browsed the thumbnails, which, I guess, is what a photo should do.', '2009-06-22 16:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
