(5540004, 801054, 90947, '<td valign="top">I love this fast water photo.  Like the others, I feel that, although absolutely gorgeous, it is not a serene scene.  The implied speed of the rushing speed of the water is at the other end of the spectrum.  However, with that said, I really love this shot.  It is perhaps my favorite of the rushing water shots.  I particularly like the way the water spray makes it appear as if the water just vanishes into nothingness.   This would be a shot I would be proud to hang on my wall.</td>', 'I love this fast water photo.  Like the others, I feel that, although absolutely gorgeous, it is not a serene scene.  The implied speed of the rushing speed of the water is at the other end of the spectrum.  However, with that said, I really love this shot.  It is perhaps my favorite of the rushing water shots.  I particularly like the way the water spray makes it appear as if the water just vanishes into nothingness.   This would be a shot I would be proud to hang on my wall.', '2009-06-22 17:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5540025, 800892, 60899, '<td valign="top">WoW !! How did you take this ? Better from where :P</td>', 'WoW !! How did you take this ? Better from where :P', '2009-06-22 17:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
