(5541403, 800468, 79955, '<td valign="top">This IMHO is great !! I can hear the silence and see the silence. The toning is appropriate. Composition top notch. Balance of sharpness &amp; softness is just right. I half expect some big boat to emerge from the fog and break all the silence. Brilliant. 1st 10 so far.</td>', 'This IMHO is great !! I can hear the silence and see the silence. The toning is appropriate. Composition top notch. Balance of sharpness & softness is just right. I half expect some big boat to emerge from the fog and break all the silence. Brilliant. 1st 10 so far.', '2009-06-23 23:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5541413, 800996, 79955, '<td valign="top">wow ! this is very impactful for a Zen shot and I totally dig it. The use of slow SS is excellent. composition is excellent. The whites are very well controlled. I''d love to be there. 2nd 10</td>', 'wow ! this is very impactful for a Zen shot and I totally dig it. The use of slow SS is excellent. composition is excellent. The whites are very well controlled. I''d love to be there. 2nd 10', '2009-06-23 23:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5541418, 801086, 79955, '<td valign="top">Concept is good , but I feel execution could be improved. In it''s current state , the simplicity I am looking for is not there. I would recommend a crop like this. I would do a square crop that includes the ripple at the top left corner and include the soloe bubble in the middle.<br/> <br/>After the crop , then I would consider to make it a little more high key or low key. Hope this helps. 5</td>', 'Concept is good , but I feel execution could be improved. In it''s current state , the simplicity I am looking for is not there. I would recommend a crop like this. I would do a square crop that includes the ripple at the top left corner and include the soloe bubble in the middle. After the crop , then I would consider to make it a little more high key or low key. Hope this helps. 5', '2009-06-23 23:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5541419, 800549, 79955, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shallow DOF. If the background was less complex then the shot would have truly met the challenge. As it is now , the background spoils the simplicity for a Zen shot. 6</td>', 'Nice use of shallow DOF. If the background was less complex then the shot would have truly met the challenge. As it is now , the background spoils the simplicity for a Zen shot. 6', '2009-06-23 23:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
