(5541423, 800182, 79955, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture !!! I would have cropped the tree out so that the shot would meet the Zen theme better. With the tree out, the shot becomes a lot simpler and more pleasing to look at. 6</td>', 'Wonderful capture !!! I would have cropped the tree out so that the shot would meet the Zen theme better. With the tree out, the shot becomes a lot simpler and more pleasing to look at. 6', '2009-06-23 23:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
