(5542466, 800578, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems a little over-something. Oversaturated on the greens a bit, and oversharpened to where the trees look like they were ''shopped in to the pic. Edges seem a little unrealistic is what I think the problem is for me. I think the basic image is good, however. I''m divided on this one, but I will err on the positive side.</td>', 'Seems a little over-something. Oversaturated on the greens a bit, and oversharpened to where the trees look like they were ''shopped in to the pic. Edges seem a little unrealistic is what I think the problem is for me. I think the basic image is good, however. I''m divided on this one, but I will err on the positive side.', '2009-06-24 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5542474, 800953, 83313, '<td valign="top">A little kinky here. I do like your take, the photograph is very good, and I have to admit, this conveys silence. Probably not really very Zen, but, hey, it''s only a photo challenge.</td>', 'A little kinky here. I do like your take, the photograph is very good, and I have to admit, this conveys silence. Probably not really very Zen, but, hey, it''s only a photo challenge.', '2009-06-24 14:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5542628, 800213, 100975, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title.  Serendipity means beginners luck or chance.  Did you mean Serenity?</td>', 'I don''t get the title.  Serendipity means beginners luck or chance.  Did you mean Serenity?', '2009-06-24 16:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5542679, 800928, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal composition, good bright colours too.</td>', 'I like the diagonal composition, good bright colours too.', '2009-06-24 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
