(5549570, 800891, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh yes!  This makes me escape to my zen zone just looking at it.   My score at rollover was lower than this -- like 6.774.  I guess I just got a tad luckier that some of my lower voters didn''t finish their 20%.  This is so award-worthy!  Congratulations on a 5th place honorable mention!</td>', 'Oh yes!  This makes me escape to my zen zone just looking at it.   My score at rollover was lower than this -- like 6.774.  I guess I just got a tad luckier that some of my lower voters didn''t finish their 20%.  This is so award-worthy!  Congratulations on a 5th place honorable mention!', '2009-06-29 11:13:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5549571, 800961, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Zen indeed!  I love this type of photography.  Flawlessly done!  Congratulations on first page honors :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow!  Zen indeed!  I love this type of photography.  Flawlessly done!  Congratulations on first page honors :) ', '2009-06-29 11:14:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5549575, 801067, 24454, '<td valign="top">Anna, this is so awesome!  I always think of this type of photography for zen.  I think the last zen challenge, I even scoured the nurseries hoping to find one of these little trees but couldn''t.  I love the way you have presented it in such light pretty white!  Congratulations on 8th place.</td>', 'Anna, this is so awesome!  I always think of this type of photography for zen.  I think the last zen challenge, I even scoured the nurseries hoping to find one of these little trees but couldn''t.  I love the way you have presented it in such light pretty white!  Congratulations on 8th place.', '2009-06-29 11:16:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5549576, 800819, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love the title.  It ties it all together and seems very zen.  This is so. . .so. . ."Joe Dannels exquisite" :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love the title.  It ties it all together and seems very zen.  This is so. . .so. . ."Joe Dannels exquisite" :) ', '2009-06-29 11:17:58.000000', NULL, 0),
