(5549579, 800602, 24454, '<td valign="top">Yes. . .this is zen if I ever saw it.  And "Bear-Music flawless" too!  I love it!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Yes. . .this is zen if I ever saw it.  And "Bear-Music flawless" too!  I love it! ', '2009-06-29 11:20:06.000000', NULL, 0),
