(5555790, 800602, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautifully serene and quiet. I love the negative space and the basic colors.</td>', 'Beautifully serene and quiet. I love the negative space and the basic colors.', '2009-07-02 14:42:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5556609, 800674, 31637, '<td valign="top">Found this in the Critique Club section:<br/> <br/>When I first saw this photo, I was a bit irked that it topped my entry for the challenge, but after a while, it grew on me a bit. This is a very good photo, and deserves the score it recieved since its so relaxing to look at. It fits the theme of the challenge perfectly, and the technicalities of this image are spot on. <br/> <br/>The subject is not the most interesting thing to view, but it feels so alone, so left out. Focus is excellent, making the water surface seem like its holding it back, yet giving it life at the same time, the perfect balance, which is Zen. <br/> <br/>Great job, well deserved score.</td>', 'Found this in the Critique Club section: When I first saw this photo, I was a bit irked that it topped my entry for the challenge, but after a while, it grew on me a bit. This is a very good photo, and deserves the score it recieved since its so relaxing to look at. It fits the theme of the challenge perfectly, and the technicalities of this image are spot on.  The subject is not the most interesting thing to view, but it feels so alone, so left out. Focus is excellent, making the water surface seem like its holding it back, yet giving it life at the same time, the perfect balance, which is Zen.  Great job, well deserved score.', '2009-07-02 20:56:30.000000', NULL, 0),
