(5583811, 800234, 39427, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot man, looks very "hotpasta" - I gotta think the only reason you were docked points was for some fault in the technicals but STILL below 6.x for this is a travesty.  Boats look a bit murky/grainy in the detail and yes maybe over is too ''blue'' (and i love saturation), but the clouds and the sky I don''t get it, if i voted i would have expected top 10</td>', 'This is an awesome shot man, looks very "hotpasta" - I gotta think the only reason you were docked points was for some fault in the technicals but STILL below 6.x for this is a travesty.  Boats look a bit murky/grainy in the detail and yes maybe over is too ''blue'' (and i love saturation), but the clouds and the sky I don''t get it, if i voted i would have expected top 10', '2009-07-23 02:16:37.000000', NULL, 0),
