(5890395, 799751, 68504, '<td valign="top">In spite of still not having figured out exactly what objects (in our oppressively objective world), even with hints!, I am drawn to this.  Title and full quote and Don''s lines are bonuses, but primarily my experience seems to be exactly in line with zeuszen''s desiderata.<br/> <br/>I don''t know if I am surprised this did as well as it did in this venue, or terribly disappointed that this didn''t come even close to the front page.<br/> <br/>(Tickled you did this with the little Panny and on your tabletop studio.  Fine art is just there at our least fingertips if we let ourselves loosen our grasp).</td>', 'In spite of still not having figured out exactly what objects (in our oppressively objective world), even with hints!, I am drawn to this.  Title and full quote and Don''s lines are bonuses, but primarily my experience seems to be exactly in line with zeuszen''s desiderata. I don''t know if I am surprised this did as well as it did in this venue, or terribly disappointed that this didn''t come even close to the front page. (Tickled you did this with the little Panny and on your tabletop studio.  Fine art is just there at our least fingertips if we let ourselves loosen our grasp).', '2010-03-04 14:45:48.000000', NULL, 0),
